== Trivia ==

* Ikrus may be a reference to [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Icarus Icarus] from Greek mythology. In the myth, Icarus ignored his father Daedalus' instructions not to fly too close to the Sun, causing the beeswax in his wings to melt. Icarus fell from the sky, plunged into the sea, and drowned.

